    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling (Chick embryo (Gallus gallus domesticus) limb bud & embryonic blastoderm)",
        "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling faithfully reproduces Chick embryo (Gallus gallus domesticus) limb bud & embryonic blastoderm morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-1>,
