    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Chick embryo (Gallus gallus domesticus) limb bud & embryonic blastoderm specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 38.1/100, audit 2026-10-19-french-flag-morphogen-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py> ;
    schema:about "Chick embryo (Gallus gallus domesticus) limb bud & embryonic blastoderm" ;
