<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Code-to-model traceability: 50/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Contains basic docstrings for `compute_sdd_profile` and `classify_french_flag` (L25-36), but lacks section/equation mappings to Wolpert (1969) Sec. 2-4, Crick (1970), Tickle et al. (1975), Riddle et al. (1993), Ben-Zvi & Barkai (2010), and the Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_011_french_flag_morphogen.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L25–L36: Minimal helper docstrings without paper equation or Lean theorem links <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L25-L36>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Model fidelity to source: 46/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates only the closed-form steady-state formula `c0 * exp(-x / lam)` (L25-27) with linear thresholds `T1=2/3, T2=1/3` (L30-35) that produce a compressed Blue zone (`0.0853` instead of `0.3333`). Omits Wolpert's (1969) linear source-sink diffusion model, omits time-dependent PDE integration of `dc/dt = D d^2c/dx^2 - k c`, omits Tickle et al. (1975) ZPA graft superposition, and omits Ben-Zvi & Barkai (2010) expansion-repression scaling feedback." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L25–L36: Closed-form SDD formula with uncalibrated linear thresholds and no PDE solver or ZPA duplication <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L25-L36>" ;
    pk:hasScore 4.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Morphometric validation: 32/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` reports only a single uncalibrated Blue-zone fraction (`0.0853` vs reference `0.3333`, L79-93) without positional precision error `sigma_x`, scaling invariance CV across HH18-HH28 stages, ZPA digit sequence verification, or specimen radial fit `r` / RMSE." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L79–L93: Single morphometric metric with large uncalibrated discrepancy (0.0853 vs 0.3333) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L79-L93>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-unscaled-sdd-blue-zone-fraction-at-l-300-um-linear-t1-2-3-threshold> ;
    pk:hasScore 3.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — MorphoEval overall 38.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py` (41.2/100). The baseline script evaluates only a closed-form exponential decay `c0*exp(-x/lam)` with uncalibrated linear thresholds (`T1=2/3, T2=1/3`), omitting Wolpert's (1969) linear source-sink model, the time-dependent SDD PDE solver, Tickle et al.'s (1975) anterior ZPA graft mirror-image digit duplication (`4-3-2-2-3-4`), Ben-Zvi & Barkai's (2010) expansion-repression scaling feedback across growing domains, ZPA ablation negative controls, and computer-vision segmentation of the vendored `Gallus gallus` embryo specimen image. Overall 38.1/100 (faithfulness 31.3, reproducibility 54.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 46, Morphological realism / specimen match 18, Parameter expressivity 34, Morphometric validation 32, Source and data traceability 48, Code-to-model traceability 50, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/french_flag_morphogen_comparison.png: rendered output of 1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py at b9976f8, image/png, 59710 B, 1120×700 px, artifact_sha256 9dc970e06e20f6702cbb9e3d329f5bb0a6a323e766f9bba462745dbfc8ed1658 (sha256 9dc970e06e20f6702cbb9e3d329f5bb0a6a323e766f9bba462745dbfc8ed1658), spec_fingerprint 8c772d71b75bec8f158cb37c09ad0b582febd6312d060c187ac44cf5cbb1bf84. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c772d71b75bec8f158cb37c09ad0b582febd6312d060c187ac44cf5cbb1bf84; artifact_sha256: 9dc970e06e20f6702cbb9e3d329f5bb0a6a323e766f9bba462745dbfc8ed1658; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/french_flag_morphogen/french_flag_morphogen_reference.json=deae09091fa98a1b..., datasets/french_flag_morphogen/french_flag_specimen.jpg=7163e90c56e1316e..., datasets/french_flag_morphogen/scout_manifest.json=d3bd7cc1c62dd2cb...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement Tickle, Summerbell & Wolpert (1975) and Riddle et al. (1993) chick wing bud ZPA / Sonic hedgehog (Shh) morphogen experiments across 4 regimes: wild-type posterior ZPA (4-3-2), anterior ZPA graft mirror-image duplication (4-3-2-2-3-4), attenuated anterior ZPA graft (4-3-2-3), and ZPA ablation / cyclopamine negative control (0 digits).",
        "remediation needed: Implement all three positional information mechanisms: (1) Wolpert (1969) linear source-sink diffusion c_lin(x) = c0*(1 - x/L), (2) time-dependent & analytical finite-domain Synthesis-Diffusion-Degradation (SDD) PDE dc/dt = D d^2c/dx^2 - k*c, and (3) Ben-Zvi & Barkai (2010) Expansion-Repression (ER) dynamic feedback scaling across growing domains L in [180, 660] um (HH18-HH28).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/french_flag_morphogen/french_flag_morphogen_reference.json` and `datasets/french_flag_morphogen/french_flag_specimen.jpg` at runtime, segment the 72h HH18-20 Gallus gallus embryo organizer and radial area vasculosa optical density profile c(r), and fit the exponential SDD decay model (r, RMSE, and 3-zone concentric French-Flag territories).",
        "remediation needed: Upgrade `measure_morphoeval()`, `--self-test`, and CLI parameter flags (`--D`, `--k`, `--L`, `--c0`, `--anterior-graft`, `--noise-sigma`, `--seed`), and render a 6-panel synthesis figure and animated ontogenetic growth + ZPA duplication GIF." ;
    pk:hasScore 3.81e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Parameter expressivity: 34/100" ;
